WEBVTT

00:16.120 --> 00:17.050
<i>How...</i>

00:18.400 --> 00:20.790
<i>did things end up like this?</i>

00:21.680 --> 00:23.780
<i>I came into the sauna.</i>

00:23.780 --> 00:26.430
<i>I thought Gashita had come 
in, but it was Malika.</i>

00:27.680 --> 00:28.960
<i>My hand...</i>

00:28.960 --> 00:31.300
<i>touched some pounded rice cake...</i>

00:31.520 --> 00:34.980
<i>Th-This is bad!</i>

00:50.320 --> 00:54.650
<b>Chillin'</b>

00:50.320 --> 00:54.650
<b>in My 30s after Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</b>

02:11.580 --> 02:13.500
<i>Th-This may have been an accident...</i>

02:14.480 --> 02:17.150
<i>but when I consider what I've seen so far...</i>

02:17.150 --> 02:18.810
<i>what awaits me...</i>

02:18.810 --> 02:19.660
<i>is death!</i>

02:20.290 --> 02:23.660
<i>L-Let go... then immediately get 
down on your knees and beg!</i>

02:23.660 --> 02:26.160
<i>Now, while she's still rational!</i>

02:27.970 --> 02:29.170
<i>My body won't move!</i>

02:29.590 --> 02:31.420
<i>Why won't it do as I say?!</i>

02:31.980 --> 02:35.040
<i>Could it be that my hand is hesitating?</i>

02:35.040 --> 02:36.420
<i>Deciding between life...</i>

02:36.420 --> 02:37.820
<i>and this pounded rice cake?</i>

02:41.050 --> 02:42.660
Mister Dariel?

02:42.660 --> 02:44.430
<i>Th-This is the end!</i>

02:44.970 --> 02:46.850
U-Um...

02:46.850 --> 02:48.430
M-Mister Dariel...

02:49.080 --> 02:51.850
You're going to the Center Guild, right?

02:51.850 --> 02:52.690
What?

02:55.000 --> 02:58.480
When I realized that we 
don't have much time left,

02:58.480 --> 03:01.160
I wanted even a little bit 
more time to talk with you.

03:02.480 --> 03:08.620
I've been thinking that something 
like this might happen.

03:09.280 --> 03:12.210
Because you really are an 
amazing person, Mister Dariel!

03:13.710 --> 03:15.690
Ever since you came here...

03:15.690 --> 03:19.470
everything about Lux Village 
has changed for the better.

03:20.030 --> 03:22.750
And since you got the mythril back...

03:22.750 --> 03:24.970
lots of different people have started coming.

03:26.200 --> 03:30.090
Father and everyone are always smiling.

03:31.330 --> 03:32.470
And me, too.

03:33.920 --> 03:35.810
This is my first time feeling this way...

03:37.240 --> 03:39.240
and this feeling is something you gave me.

03:40.510 --> 03:42.220
Thank you.

03:43.350 --> 03:45.740
A-And that's why, you see!

03:46.600 --> 03:48.090
No matter where you go...

03:48.090 --> 03:52.250
I'll be cheering you on, 
with everyone else, forever!

03:53.760 --> 03:56.780
So, give it everything you've 
got at Center Guild, all right?

03:59.120 --> 04:00.240
<i>Malika...</i>

04:00.980 --> 04:03.000
<i>you're always like this, aren't you?</i>

04:04.050 --> 04:06.350
<i>You're always putting on a smile 
for someone else's sake...</i>

04:08.400 --> 04:10.620
<i>and you stifle your own feelings.</i>

04:11.180 --> 04:13.940
<i>You probably think they're just selfishness,</i>

04:14.600 --> 04:15.890
<i>but that isn't true.</i>

04:16.960 --> 04:18.190
Mister Dariel?

04:18.480 --> 04:19.590
I'm not going.

04:21.010 --> 04:24.450
I'm thinking of declining the 
offer to go to Center Guild.

04:24.810 --> 04:25.880
But why?

04:27.300 --> 04:31.820
When I was wandering around after 
I got fired, you found me...

04:31.820 --> 04:33.280
and brought me with you.

04:34.730 --> 04:37.210
When I had nowhere to go,

04:37.950 --> 04:41.820
Lux Village took me in. 
I love this village. That's why.

04:43.680 --> 04:44.670
Besides...

04:45.560 --> 04:48.930
Not being able to eat your 
stew would make me sad.

04:57.810 --> 04:59.130
I'm so glad.

04:59.770 --> 05:01.900
I can still stay with you.

05:04.700 --> 05:05.950
I'm so glad.

05:10.220 --> 05:11.180
Malika...

05:26.480 --> 05:28.560
<i>And so, I found one more...</i>

05:29.910 --> 05:32.690
<i>one more reason to stay in Lux Village.</i>

05:35.480 --> 05:38.480
<b>Episode 6</b>

05:35.480 --> 05:38.480
<b>Dariel, Enveloped by Steam.</b>

05:53.540 --> 05:54.540
Father!

05:54.540 --> 05:55.890
I am he—

06:03.250 --> 06:05.550
So, you've come, Bashbarza?

06:06.450 --> 06:09.200
What are you doing, Father?

06:09.200 --> 06:10.800
Rehabilitation.

06:11.630 --> 06:13.810
This wound that the Hero gave me...

06:14.540 --> 06:17.950
a moderate amount of movement 
should help it heal faster.

06:20.080 --> 06:21.370
Come in.

06:21.370 --> 06:23.350
I've had a meal prepared.

06:31.400 --> 06:32.570
My son,

06:33.140 --> 06:36.350
are you making good progress in 
your work with the Four Generals?

06:36.350 --> 06:38.040
Y-Yes, sir.

06:38.040 --> 06:41.330
I see. That is good.

06:41.600 --> 06:45.340
Are you paying close attention 
to what Dariel says?

06:45.580 --> 06:47.580
Y-Yes, sir.

06:50.390 --> 06:53.340
When I decided that I would retire,

06:53.340 --> 06:56.350
everyone around made quite a fuss.

06:57.100 --> 06:59.420
The fact that I was the strongest of us

06:59.420 --> 07:02.090
made them all the more reluctant to allow me to retire.

07:02.770 --> 07:06.360
And the youth of the four 
of you made them uneasy.

07:06.650 --> 07:07.580
However...

07:08.110 --> 07:11.570
Dariel put a stop to all of that.

07:12.350 --> 07:17.580
He had served the previous Four Generals 
perfectly as an aide. Since he was staying...

07:18.240 --> 07:22.580
we were able to stop the flow of objections.

07:26.690 --> 07:31.590
Do you remember what I said when I passed 
my position in the Four Generals to you?

07:34.340 --> 07:38.850
"The greatest stroke of luck 
in my life was meeting Dariel."

07:39.460 --> 07:42.350
"Passing such good fortune on to you..."

07:42.860 --> 07:45.860
"is how I celebrate you 
taking up this position."

07:48.670 --> 07:50.860
How is Dariel?

07:52.400 --> 07:54.800
You aren't giving him trouble, are you?

07:54.800 --> 07:57.100
I-I wouldn't dream of it!

07:57.100 --> 08:00.490
Dariel is serving admirably 
as aide to the Four Generals!

08:00.490 --> 08:03.500
There isn't a single thing for 
you to worry about, Father!

08:03.500 --> 08:06.600
So, please, rest easy and devote 
your attention to your recovery.

08:30.360 --> 08:32.940
F-Father...

08:33.920 --> 08:38.370
Appeals from many demons 
have been delivered to me.

08:39.020 --> 08:42.210
Their sons and nephews have been dismissed 
as aides to the Four Generals,

08:42.210 --> 08:43.870
and they ask for my clemency!

08:43.870 --> 08:46.210
They ask for me to intervene with you.

08:48.970 --> 08:52.320
I didn't think that you were this stupid.

08:52.320 --> 08:55.860
To think that you'd choose to let 
go of a treasure like Dariel!

08:57.650 --> 09:00.120
Bring Dariel back here immediately!

09:00.120 --> 09:02.130
And then beg for his forgiveness!

09:02.130 --> 09:06.650
That is the only path remaining for 
you to continue in the Four Generals.

09:08.970 --> 09:10.260
No.

09:11.590 --> 09:14.740
If relying on trash like him is 
how I remain in the Four Generals...

09:14.740 --> 09:16.070
there'd be no point.

09:18.150 --> 09:22.400
I must achieve success 
through my own abilities!

09:24.050 --> 09:27.210
I am the son of Granbarza, celebrated as
 the strongest in history!

09:27.210 --> 09:28.920
Your son!

09:28.920 --> 09:33.310
I will prove to everyone that the 
son of a lion is also a lion!

09:40.160 --> 09:42.860
Why do you not try to work together?

09:53.360 --> 09:56.150
Where are you and what are 
you doing right now...

09:56.900 --> 09:57.950
Dariel?

10:02.080 --> 10:05.720
It's rare for that girl to sleep in, isn't it?

10:05.720 --> 10:07.000
Usually, she'd be...

10:07.920 --> 10:09.100
Good morning!

10:09.100 --> 10:12.090
I have to make Mister Dariel's meal!

10:12.390 --> 10:13.430
...and yet...

10:14.010 --> 10:15.380
Malika?

10:17.160 --> 10:19.220
Breakfast is ready.

10:20.120 --> 10:21.280
Oh my.

10:21.850 --> 10:22.850
Well, well.

10:23.570 --> 10:25.350
Aren't they getting along nicely?

10:26.980 --> 10:29.100
I-I'm sorry I'm late!

10:29.820 --> 10:33.430
And I'm sorry I wasn't able 
to help make breakfast!

10:39.180 --> 10:41.450
A-Are you all right?

10:41.840 --> 10:44.700
I-I'm sorry.

10:48.640 --> 10:50.540
What's wrong, Dariel?

10:50.540 --> 10:52.600
You look really tired.

10:53.840 --> 10:55.310
Could it be...

10:56.460 --> 10:59.800
you spent too much time 
in the sauna yesterday?

10:59.800 --> 11:02.430
That's no good. You need to learn moderation!

11:02.430 --> 11:05.400
Don't forget to use the water 
bath and take breaks, all right?

11:05.400 --> 11:07.720
I-I'll remember that.

11:08.040 --> 11:10.850
Yes, let's aim for the best sauna experience.

11:10.850 --> 11:12.830
Y-Yes, sir.

11:11.680 --> 11:12.830
Malika...

11:13.480 --> 11:14.720
Oh, right. Dariel?

11:14.720 --> 11:15.500
Yes?

11:14.720 --> 11:16.140
I'm happy for you.

11:15.500 --> 11:16.720
Have you heard of hot water masters?

11:16.140 --> 11:18.060
Th-Thank you.

11:16.720 --> 11:17.280
Yes, sir!

11:17.280 --> 11:19.030
Really? What about this 
other thing that's popular

11:19.030 --> 11:22.030
<b>Chillin'
 in My 30s after Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</b>

11:28.700 --> 11:31.380
<i>Th-This really is uncomfortable.</i>

11:36.070 --> 11:38.000
<i>Does he already know?</i>

11:38.000 --> 11:39.370
Dariel?

11:39.370 --> 11:40.760
Y-Yes, sir?

11:40.760 --> 11:45.260
The herb-gathering quests have piled up again.
Will you take care of them for me?

11:45.260 --> 11:47.770
I-I'll do that.

11:47.770 --> 11:48.910
<i>So, that wasn't it.</i>

11:48.910 --> 11:50.200
Mister Dariel!

11:50.730 --> 11:53.670
Could I ask you for a little help?

11:54.480 --> 11:56.910
Oh. Y-Yes, ma'am!

12:00.610 --> 12:02.620
You're such a help.

12:02.620 --> 12:03.490
It's nothing.

12:07.470 --> 12:08.490
Mister Dariel?

12:12.810 --> 12:15.500
I hope you and Malika continue 
to get along well together.

12:15.500 --> 12:18.750
<i>She clearly knows exactly what happened!</i>

12:19.150 --> 12:22.850
<i>It's true that this and 
also that happened, but...</i>

12:23.800 --> 12:26.590
<i>I can't keep silent about this!</i>

12:26.590 --> 12:28.930
<i>I have to hurry up and say something!</i>

12:28.930 --> 12:30.560
<i>But what?</i>

12:31.310 --> 12:32.710
<i>All of that?</i>

12:33.190 --> 12:35.690
<i>No, no. That wouldn't be right.</i>

12:36.430 --> 12:37.690
<i>This is where I should probably...</i>

12:38.070 --> 12:40.070
Please let me have Miss Malika.

12:40.640 --> 12:41.510
<i>Marriage?</i>

12:42.040 --> 12:44.110
<i>Am I going to get married?</i>

12:44.110 --> 12:45.780
<i>Of course I am.</i>

12:45.780 --> 12:47.910
<i>You have to be a man about this, Dariel!</i>

12:47.910 --> 12:49.160
Dariel!

12:49.440 --> 12:50.660
Y-Yes, sir?

12:53.830 --> 12:55.420
We have to talk.

13:00.010 --> 13:02.800
My wife and I are getting old.

13:02.800 --> 13:06.060
This is your and Malika's era.

13:07.170 --> 13:08.700
<i>There's no mistake.</i>

13:08.700 --> 13:11.530
<i>Father really does know 
what happened last night!</i>

13:11.530 --> 13:13.340
<i>I-I have to say something before he does!</i>

13:14.490 --> 13:15.690
Her...

13:14.490 --> 13:15.690
I...

13:15.690 --> 13:17.940
Her pounded rice cakes were just too amazing.

13:15.690 --> 13:19.690
I want you to take my place as mayor.

13:19.990 --> 13:20.770
Huh?

13:21.380 --> 13:23.160
What? Mayor?

13:23.160 --> 13:24.800
You mean me?

13:24.800 --> 13:25.920
Yes.

13:27.440 --> 13:30.270
You're the one who took 
back the Mythril Mine.

13:30.270 --> 13:33.450
You're the one who brought life back to Lux Village.

13:33.730 --> 13:36.960
And in terms of character, 
no one is more qualified.

13:37.220 --> 13:40.910
N-No, it's far too great 
a responsibility for me.

13:40.910 --> 13:44.460
It's like that for everyone at first.
 I was like that, too.

13:44.940 --> 13:48.980
But that's how people grow.

13:48.980 --> 13:50.980
They continue to carry their 
heavy responsibilities,

13:50.980 --> 13:53.490
and eventually their efforts bear fruit.

13:53.490 --> 13:55.230
That's what life is.

13:55.760 --> 13:58.870
I will be sad to leave this work,

13:58.870 --> 14:01.230
but I will happily pass 
it on, if it's to you.

14:01.940 --> 14:03.160
<i>Father...</i>

14:07.640 --> 14:09.360
<i>Taking on heavy responsibilities...</i>

14:13.830 --> 14:15.470
<i>will one day bear fruit.</i>

14:15.470 --> 14:16.710
<i>That's life.</i>

14:20.800 --> 14:22.490
All right.

14:22.490 --> 14:25.210
Please allow me to take you up on your offer.

14:25.210 --> 14:26.240
Of course!

14:26.240 --> 14:28.010
But before that...

14:28.010 --> 14:30.090
I have just one request.

14:33.380 --> 14:35.970
Please allow me to marry Miss Malika.

14:36.830 --> 14:38.780
I will devote everything 
I have to making her happy.

14:39.700 --> 14:42.510
O-Of course...

14:49.460 --> 14:50.550
<i>This girl...</i>

14:51.180 --> 14:54.990
<i>I had nowhere to go, and she 
created a place for me to belong.</i>

14:56.010 --> 14:57.030
Malika...

14:57.930 --> 15:01.000
Will you marry me?

15:12.220 --> 15:14.010
Mister Dariel!

15:21.340 --> 15:22.230
Sting!

15:25.220 --> 15:26.740
Come now...

15:26.740 --> 15:28.810
They really do get along very well.

15:30.870 --> 15:31.990
Malika!

15:37.520 --> 15:40.580
Let's be happy, the two of us, together!

15:44.010 --> 15:44.970
Yes!

15:45.670 --> 15:48.720
But it isn't just two of us.

15:48.720 --> 15:50.490
It's three.

15:50.490 --> 15:51.500
What?

15:51.500 --> 15:54.690
<i>And so, I married Malika...</i>

15:56.860 --> 15:58.910
<i>became the mayor of Lux Village,</i>

15:59.580 --> 16:00.970
<i>and a whole year has passed.</i>

16:05.100 --> 16:09.110
<i>Since then, Lux Village has 
grown bigger and bigger.</i>

16:10.000 --> 16:12.450
<i>The processing of mythril has flourished,</i>

16:12.450 --> 16:15.120
<i>and the village is even more 
prosperous than it was at its peak.</i>

16:15.430 --> 16:16.500
<i>That's what father says.</i>

16:18.640 --> 16:23.370
<i>It's all thanks to what you taught me.</i>

16:24.250 --> 16:28.130
<i>Mister Smith, please keep watching 
over us for a long time to come.</i>

16:37.930 --> 16:39.100
I'm home.

16:39.100 --> 16:40.140
Welcome back,

16:40.460 --> 16:41.420
husband!

16:42.880 --> 16:43.890
Hey!

16:44.230 --> 16:47.900
Gran really is just like a tiny Malika.

16:49.200 --> 16:51.400
His eyes are just like yours.

16:51.990 --> 16:54.800
<i>Gran. My son.</i>

16:54.800 --> 16:58.410
<i>For his name, I borrowed a bit from 
someone I loved like a father.</i>

17:00.480 --> 17:02.730
<i>He raised me for thirty years...</i>

17:02.730 --> 17:04.730
<i>Lord Granbarza of the Four Generals.</i>

17:08.250 --> 17:11.940
<i>Only a year ago, I lived among demons.</i>

17:13.900 --> 17:17.680
<i>Now it feels like the distant past.</i>

17:21.980 --> 17:23.930
This is huge, Big Bro!

17:24.350 --> 17:25.180
Huh?

17:26.490 --> 17:27.940
The Hero is coming?

17:28.180 --> 17:31.150
Yeah. I heard they're almost here.

17:31.150 --> 17:35.150
So, guild master, is this 
"hero" amazing somehow?

17:35.640 --> 17:38.660
Y-You don't know, but you were making a fuss?

17:39.510 --> 17:41.160
The Hero, you see...

17:42.030 --> 17:44.270
bears the duty of defeating the Demon King.

17:44.270 --> 17:47.190
They've overcome the Center 
Guild's harsh trials.

17:47.190 --> 17:50.080
Only one person can claim the title...

17:50.080 --> 17:52.920
They are the strongest of adventurers.

17:53.200 --> 17:56.400
<i>From the demons' perspective, 
they're just murderers.</i>

17:56.950 --> 17:58.930
<i>I saw him when I was an 
aide to the Four Generals.</i>

18:00.130 --> 18:03.430
<i>He came after anyone he perceived as 
a threat, no matter who they were.</i>

18:03.830 --> 18:05.540
<i>That bearded old man!</i>

18:08.080 --> 18:10.150
<i>What would he be coming here for?</i>

18:10.400 --> 18:11.370
<i>It can't be...</i>

18:11.370 --> 18:14.310
<i>is he coming to deal with me, a former 
member of the Demon King's Army?</i>

18:14.310 --> 18:16.100
We can't just sit here like this!

18:16.100 --> 18:18.150
We have to prepare to show 
them our hospitality!

18:18.880 --> 18:20.160
As for greeting them...

18:20.410 --> 18:22.670
Dariel, I'll leave it to you.

18:22.670 --> 18:24.060
Y-Yes, sir.

18:28.220 --> 18:29.800
They say it's the Hero.

18:29.800 --> 18:32.150
Coming from Center Guild.

18:32.150 --> 18:34.670
I wonder what the Hero is like.

18:35.260 --> 18:37.600
<i>What do I do if we have 
to fight to the death?</i>

18:43.620 --> 18:44.430
<i>Huh?</i>

18:47.690 --> 18:48.430
<i>What?</i>

18:48.860 --> 18:50.910
<i>No... beard?</i>

18:54.000 --> 18:57.940
For accommodating our sudden visit, 
I cannot adequately express my gratitude.

18:58.270 --> 18:59.520
I am the Hero, Laidy.

18:59.520 --> 19:02.450
I will engrave your assistance 
deeply into my heart.

19:02.970 --> 19:05.110
I am Sessha, a spearman.

19:05.110 --> 19:07.450
I'm Satome! I favor the shield!

19:08.070 --> 19:09.960
I'm the mayor, Dariel.

19:13.000 --> 19:14.240
Is something wrong?

19:14.240 --> 19:15.460
Oh. No.

19:16.000 --> 19:20.220
To think that the honored Hero is a 
young lady... It took me by surprise.

19:20.950 --> 19:24.000
My honored predecessor, engaged in
 mortal combat with a demon,

19:24.000 --> 19:26.220
suffered grave wounds, and was retired.

19:26.560 --> 19:28.480
<i>So that's what happened.</i>

19:28.480 --> 19:31.280
<i>Then no one here would recognize my face.</i>

19:31.280 --> 19:33.520
<i>It doesn't seem like I have 
to worry about getting killed!</i>

19:33.520 --> 19:34.980
Dariel.

19:35.540 --> 19:39.490
Are you a person who would judge 
others by their age or gender?

19:39.930 --> 19:40.800
What?

19:40.800 --> 19:43.490
Battle is not a privilege 
reserved only for men!

19:44.240 --> 19:46.650
P-Please pardon my rudeness.

19:48.750 --> 19:51.170
<i>This Hero is scary!</i>

19:53.440 --> 19:54.750
Still...

19:55.310 --> 19:59.940
To think that a country village like this 
held the key to defeating the Demon King.

20:01.310 --> 20:03.370
The key to defeating the Demon King?

20:05.930 --> 20:07.800
She's speaking of mythril weapons.

20:08.310 --> 20:10.380
I'd like to request something made to order.

20:11.280 --> 20:14.100
<i>I see. So that's what they're after.</i>

20:14.100 --> 20:15.310
And...

20:15.830 --> 20:18.140
Y-You're being disrespectful, Satome.

20:18.140 --> 20:20.680
It's because this region is so remote...

20:22.080 --> 20:25.580
that it's possible to make 
such a wonderfully lucky find.

20:25.580 --> 20:26.940
Okay.

20:28.280 --> 20:30.320
<i>"Always speak with dignity."</i>

20:30.320 --> 20:31.810
<i>"Assert dominance from the beginning."</i>

20:31.810 --> 20:33.160
<i>"It's all over if they take you lightly."</i>

20:33.160 --> 20:35.120
<i>"Say the opposite of what Satome does."</i>

20:35.120 --> 20:37.760
<i>The Hero is using notes to cheat!</i>

20:39.480 --> 20:40.460
<i>What a strange girl.</i>

20:43.380 --> 20:45.390
Welcome to Lux Village!

20:45.730 --> 20:48.630
Hero, you must be tired 
from your long journey.

20:49.680 --> 20:52.320
Husband, will you take little Gran?

20:52.320 --> 20:53.400
Yes, of course.

20:54.200 --> 20:56.530
Allow me to take your cloak.

20:56.530 --> 20:58.140
Yes, thank you.

21:00.570 --> 21:02.730
There, there.

21:03.800 --> 21:04.450
<i>Huh?</i>

21:05.160 --> 21:08.660
<i>Oh. Is he curious about a 
young lady he's never met?</i>

21:08.960 --> 21:12.100
I-Is that child your son?

21:12.100 --> 21:13.500
Y-Yes.

21:14.060 --> 21:15.280
I-I see.

21:15.280 --> 21:18.100
Should holding him prove taxing for you,

21:18.100 --> 21:20.040
I could...

21:20.040 --> 21:22.960
<i>Does she... like children?</i>

21:22.960 --> 21:25.930
Yes, if you wouldn't mind holding—

21:25.930 --> 21:27.610
Hey! Hurry up and hand him over!

21:27.610 --> 21:28.820
<i>She's that eager?</i>

21:29.550 --> 21:32.810
Now, come here.

21:33.200 --> 21:35.150
There, there.

21:37.120 --> 21:38.840
<i>To think that a son of mine...</i>

21:39.760 --> 21:42.240
<i>would be held by the Hero. I never 
imagined the day would come.</i>

21:43.070 --> 21:45.070
<i>I'm looking forward to his future.</i>

21:46.390 --> 21:47.570
Stop that! Gran!

21:47.860 --> 21:50.040
I'm so sorry about my son.

21:50.040 --> 21:53.800
I-It's fine. Babies do this sort of thing.

21:56.810 --> 21:58.830
<i>I'm looking forward to his future.</i>

21:59.610 --> 22:01.340
<i>Is he really going to be all right?</i>

22:01.640 --> 22:04.330
<i>Though, I suppose, this does prove it.</i>

22:05.570 --> 22:06.790
<i>He really is my son.</i>

23:41.780 --> 23:46.020
Next time on <i>Chillin' in My 30s after 
Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</i>...

23:46.510 --> 23:48.900
"Dariel Uses That One Skill."

23:47.440 --> 23:51.030
<b>Episode 7</b>

23:47.440 --> 23:51.030
<b>Dariel Uses That One Skill.</b>
